# =============================================================================
# app_main() - Main entrypoint and command dispatcher
# =============================================================================
#
# GENERAL PURPOSE:
# Single dispatcher for folder-backup (local Type 0 + domain).
# Empty argv = Type N help (not install-ensure).
#
